      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section B40-9.0 of the Administrative Code of the City of New York provides that the heads of all City Departments be authorized, provided that the essential services are not impaired, to grant leaves of absence, with pay, to an employee of any such department who has been designated as an official convention delegate or alternate.",
