      "text": "Each delegate and alternate to the National American Legion Convention requesting leave of absence with pay shall upon request of the head of his department furnish a certificate from an authorized official of the American Legion showing that he is a duly elected delegate or alternate and upon his return to the office, shall present a certificate declaring that he was in attendance at the Convention.",
